WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
My new cookbook is out!

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:11.200
The How Not to Age Cookbook
is finally out, and it is gorgeous.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.080
Let me take you on a little path.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.936
Oh my god, how pretty.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.000
We got soups,
we got the pasta chapter,

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.600
salads, desserts,
all sorts of wonderful things.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.800
Not only is every recipe healthy,

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.120
but every ingredient of
every recipe is healthy.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.760
Enjoy! Bon appétit.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.000
It's out!

